1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 5]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,570
How many times have you whistled now?

14
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,260
Are you sure it works?

15
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,290
Do you know why we call him Xiaoyu?

16
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,540
Master Zhang calls him Xiaoyu

17
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,410
because his Wedge Formation is as sharp as a blade

18
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:29,360
and his Fish-scale Formation is as tough as a turtle.

19
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,160
I don't care what he is.

20
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:32,980
We still can't save the victim.

21
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,930
I should do it myself.

22
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:36,060
Let me finish.

23
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,530
Know this.

24
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,820
- When Master Zhang was investigating the sea mine smuggling...
- Tiezui!

25
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,320
Master Zhang.

26
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:51,680
Master Zhang, what's wrong?

27
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,860
I want you

28
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:56,250
to tell me everything

29
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,950
that has happened since we entered

30
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:58,800
the Otherworld Tower.

31
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,860
Why are you hiding here?

32
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:15,540
What happened?

33
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,580
I saw a palanquin just now.

34
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,170
Why are you so shocked?

35
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,700
Perhaps the dust there is poisonous.

36
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,350
After what you've been through, what do you think?

37
00:03:36,630 --> 00:03:38,000
Everything feels contrived.

38
00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:39,570
Think about it.

39
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,120
The things I care about most

40
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,700
are my mates and my dogs.

41
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,010
Then, they vanished one by one

42
00:03:45,010 --> 00:03:45,990
before my eyes.

43
00:03:46,950 --> 00:03:48,450
Zhang Qishan cares about his men the most.

44
00:03:49,070 --> 00:03:50,450
So, it took away Unit 401.

45
00:03:51,510 --> 00:03:53,380
This tower is taking away the things everyone cares about the most.

46
00:03:53,950 --> 00:03:54,450
Xiangu.

47
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:58,020
If it wants to torture you,

48
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,820
will it take me away?

49
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,100
Don't be so full of yourself.

50
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,610
It didn't take you away.

51
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,890
That means you are not the most important person to me.

52
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:12,980
It didn't take me away.

53
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:15,050
That means I'm also not

54
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,740
the one you care about most.

55
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:17,740
Nonsense.

56
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,700
That only means it doesn't know me well.

57
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:22,890
I've told you this.

58
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,500
If it dares hurt you, even by a little,

59
00:04:26,110 --> 00:04:27,620
I'll fight it till it drops.

60
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,580
So, what is the most important thing

61
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,210
to you?

62
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:45,530
I don't know.

63
00:04:50,870 --> 00:04:52,970
I hope this tower can tell me that.

64
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:58,140
No matter

65
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,380
what it is,

66
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,700
I'll protect it for you.

67
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,530
Master Zhang, look.

68
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,290
It's like this.

69
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:17,210
We came down to search for Unit 401.

70
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:19,020
Soon,

71
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,890
we found them.

72
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:22,380
They were

73
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,500
800 meters away from us.

74
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,090
However,

75
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,400
we couldn't catch up

76
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,450
no matter how hard we tried.

77
00:05:28,790 --> 00:05:29,740
Until you

78
00:05:29,790 --> 00:05:30,650
ordered

79
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,260
everyone to step back

80
00:05:33,230 --> 00:05:34,940
and blasted a hole

81
00:05:35,670 --> 00:05:36,380
in the floor,

82
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,180
we finally found them.

83
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,500
However, we realized

84
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:40,820
the unit

85
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:42,890
was controlled by a shadow.

86
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,850
So, you went to chase after the shadow.

87
00:05:44,910 --> 00:05:45,530
Watch Unit 401!

88
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:46,140
Laogou and I

89
00:05:46,350 --> 00:05:47,620
stayed behind to watch the unit.

90
00:05:48,550 --> 00:05:49,410
But this unit

91
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,900
vanished before us

92
00:05:51,910 --> 00:05:52,920
once again.

93
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,740
Where's Unit 401?

94
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:58,060
Next, Laogou's men also vanished.

95
00:05:58,550 --> 00:06:00,380
So, we split up to look for them.

96
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,370
Then,

97
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:03,600
[Liunian Hall]
Liunian Hall

98
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,530
suddenly appeared in the corridor.

99
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:06,900
We went inside to find them

100
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:07,840
but we failed.

101
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:09,740
After that, we met you.

102
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,530
A shadow

103
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:13,090
controlled Unit 401?

104
00:06:15,230 --> 00:06:16,220
Unit 401

105
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,270
arrived two days before us.

106
00:06:18,990 --> 00:06:20,180
Why would they appear

107
00:06:20,230 --> 00:06:21,520
and wait for us somewhere 800 meters away?

108
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,650
Right.

109
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:26,690
If they have been controlled by the shadow,

110
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:28,980
then the shadow was actually waiting for us.

111
00:06:30,110 --> 00:06:31,130
I went to chase after the shadow.

112
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:32,890
You went to search for Laogou's men.

113
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:35,060
Why did we

114
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:36,980
end up in the same place?

115
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:38,620
Is this a coincidence?

116
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:40,370
I see it now.

117
00:06:41,990 --> 00:06:43,930
This tower wants to lure us here.

118
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,980
If this tower wants to lure us here,

119
00:06:46,790 --> 00:06:48,450
it just needs to use Unit 401.

120
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:50,820
Making Unit 401 vanish and appear again.

121
00:06:51,470 --> 00:06:52,100
What's the point?

122
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,930
But Master Zhang,

123
00:06:55,990 --> 00:06:57,780
monsters like this have no logic.

124
00:06:57,790 --> 00:06:59,370
It probably thinks it's fun.

125
00:06:59,910 --> 00:07:01,100
We are the toys.

126
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:02,620
It won't give up

127
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,180
until all of us are dead.

128
00:07:05,550 --> 00:07:06,660
This tower is only 80 years old.

129
00:07:07,350 --> 00:07:08,010
To put it bluntly,

130
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:10,010
it has a shorter lifespan than humans. How did it become a monster?

131
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,510
It must be working very hard.

132
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,180
So?

133
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:16,420
It works so hard just to fool around with us?

134
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,330
That doesn't seem right.

135
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,840
It lured me down here with Unit 401,

136
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,940
captured Wu Laogou's men,

137
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,290
and forced Laogou to enter deeper.

138
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:25,300
It knows both of us very well.

139
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:28,250
So, it must have done detailed research.

140
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,860
This is clearly a calculated plot.

141
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:31,660
Moreover, this person knows the Mystic Nine very well.

142
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,690
I think it's not just against a few of our clans.

143
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,370
Who is trying to harm the entire Mystic Nine?

144
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:50,780
[Changsha Garrison Command]

145
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:58,450
Commander,

146
00:07:58,990 --> 00:08:01,130
Ding Qiansui invites you to meet at the Taihe Pleasure House.

147
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:01,980
I'm not going.

148
00:08:01,980 --> 00:08:02,990
[Huo Wenhai, Changsha Special Commissioner]

149
00:08:02,990 --> 00:08:05,370
A eunuch is asking you to meet him.

150
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:06,490
Someone like him

151
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,280
is trying to return to power

152
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,780
just because he thinks he is rich.

153
00:08:10,230 --> 00:08:12,130
He is a useless remnant from the Qing Dynasty.

154
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,350
However, the messenger said something else.

155
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:15,690
Ding Qiansui

156
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:18,100
can help you get rid of Zhang Qishan.

157
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:28,490
Commander Huo,

158
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,570
there's no need to take this filth's words

159
00:08:30,910 --> 00:08:32,010
seriously.

160
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,140
Ding Qiansui is indeed a scum,

161
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:38,100
but someone like him

162
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:40,290
is exactly the kind who knows how to survive in harsh conditions.

163
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:44,260
I'm a little interested in his schemes.

164
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:49,730
Come.

165
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:51,690
Let's go see what he's up to.

166
00:08:53,150 --> 00:08:55,670
- I am wronged! - I am innocent!

167
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,420
Commander Huo, spare us!

168
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,480
We are innocent!

169
00:08:59,490 --> 00:09:00,770
Have mercy!

170
00:09:00,830 --> 00:09:02,810
- Commander Huo! - Commander Huo!

171
00:09:02,810 --> 00:09:04,450
Commander Huo, spare us!

172
00:09:04,590 --> 00:09:05,450
Commander Huo!

173
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,660
Everyone! Guns up!

174
00:09:10,110 --> 00:09:10,570
Fire!

175
00:09:17,140 --> 00:09:22,140
[Changsha Garrison Command]

176
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:37,610
I'm honored to have Commander Huo here.

177
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:39,060
Commander Huo is busy.

178
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,330
Make it quick.

179
00:09:41,590 --> 00:09:42,330
Go out.

180
00:09:50,190 --> 00:09:52,180
Commander Huo, come in and take a seat.

181
00:10:01,710 --> 00:10:02,810
Now, spill it out.

182
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,020
Commander Huo.

183
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:07,660
How's your relationship

184
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:11,090
with Master Zhang?

185
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:14,570
Trying to sow discord?

186
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:19,140
Do you know I can execute you right now

187
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,300
according to military law?

188
00:10:26,070 --> 00:10:27,780
However, I'll forget about this

189
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:28,810
since we are from the same hometown.

190
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:31,450
Commander Huo, stay.

191
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:35,380
I spoke out of turn just now.

192
00:10:35,950 --> 00:10:36,660
However,

193
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,380
the news I heard

194
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,850
scares me.

195
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,140
What news?

196
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,210
Well,

197
00:10:51,430 --> 00:10:52,690
you know

198
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,500
that the situation now is tense.

199
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:59,500
The Japanese are keeping a close eye on the situation.

200
00:11:00,990 --> 00:11:02,310
Master Zhang,

201
00:11:02,310 --> 00:11:04,880
as the Defense Commander of Changsha,

202
00:11:05,310 --> 00:11:06,210
has achieved a lot

203
00:11:06,590 --> 00:11:09,780
in defending the city over the years.

204
00:11:10,830 --> 00:11:12,880
Everyone in the city...

205
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,690
Cut to the chase.

206
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,330
Yes.

207
00:11:17,590 --> 00:11:20,210
A few days ago, I received a report from my scouts

208
00:11:20,270 --> 00:11:22,430
saying that Master Zhang

209
00:11:22,430 --> 00:11:25,180
has all these achievements

210
00:11:26,190 --> 00:11:28,570
because the Japanese are involved.

211
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,380
Of course, I didn't believe it.

212
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:36,260
Master Zhang is the backbone of the Mystic Nine.

213
00:11:36,710 --> 00:11:39,060
If what I heard was true, then...

214
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:42,060
Are you saying that Zhang Qishan is working with the Japanese?

215
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,900
Commander Huo,

216
00:11:43,950 --> 00:11:45,300
I dare not say that.

217
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:49,970
If my scout has evidence,

218
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:50,850
then...

219
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,140
If what you say is true,

220
00:11:55,950 --> 00:11:57,900
the Ministry of War will punish him accordingly.

221
00:11:58,070 --> 00:11:58,810
However,

222
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,780
if you're just framing him for no reason,

223
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,540
the Ministry of War also won't forgive you for spreading rumors.

224
00:12:05,790 --> 00:12:06,690
When the time comes,

225
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:08,140
you'll be punished.

226
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,630
When that happens,

227
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:16,080
I'll surely visit you and apologize to you in person.

228
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,500
Commander Huo,

229
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,090
calm down.

230
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:20,410
I know

231
00:12:20,730 --> 00:12:23,720
you and Zhang Qishan are both in the Ministry of War

232
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:25,280
and have a strong bond.

233
00:12:25,730 --> 00:12:27,450
When you hear the news,

234
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:30,330
you must find it hard to believe.

235
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,420
I get it.

236
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,570
If the news is true,

237
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:39,090
the Ministry of War must be angry.

238
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:41,140
My words carry little weight.

239
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,780
I can only rely on someone of your standing

240
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,380
to act as an intermediary.

241
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:50,180
The Ministry of War also needs someone

242
00:12:50,670 --> 00:12:52,500
to take his spot.

243
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,420
Am I right?

244
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:03,070
[Zhang Qishan's Personal Information]

245
00:13:03,070 --> 00:13:04,500
The war is reaching a critical point,

246
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,500
and you still need to deal with the Mystic Nine's sordid affairs?

247
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:09,800
Let's ignore this bunch of misfits.

248
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,300
I'm also a part of the Mystic Nine.

249
00:13:15,830 --> 00:13:17,020
Am I also a part of the misfits?

250
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,210
No, Commander.

251
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,020
Sorry.

252
00:13:20,590 --> 00:13:21,060
Forget it.

253
00:13:22,950 --> 00:13:23,810
Saying that

254
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,060
means you don't understand the Mystic Nine.

255
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,110
Back then,

256
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:27,420
I could serve the Ministry of War

257
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:28,800
as someone from the Mystic Nine.

258
00:13:28,830 --> 00:13:30,090
That means the Ministry of War

259
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,500
still values the people

260
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,450
from the Mystic Nine.

261
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:35,180
There must be a reason why the Mystic Nine has remained in Changsha

262
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,300
for so many years.

263
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,810
Why don't we work with the Mystic Nine?

264
00:13:39,310 --> 00:13:39,810
I tried.

265
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,300
There's no use.

266
00:13:42,430 --> 00:13:44,200
Each master of the Mystic Nine is highly skilled.

267
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,020
They are so arrogant

268
00:13:45,310 --> 00:13:47,450
that they look down on each other.

269
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:49,210
Why would they take orders from someone else?

270
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:54,140
Only Zhang Qishan can make them obey him.

271
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,610
Changsha is a place

272
00:13:59,070 --> 00:14:00,180
that looks calm on the surface

273
00:14:00,830 --> 00:14:01,450
but is full of dangers

274
00:14:02,190 --> 00:14:03,300
underneath.

275
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:06,140
Every clan of the Mystic Nine is on the same boat.

276
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,090
You don't need

277
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,300
to row faster than others,

278
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,330
but you need to keep this boat steady.

279
00:14:14,710 --> 00:14:15,610
Some obey the law.

280
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:18,850
Some stand on the front line.

281
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,420
Some are well-versed in worldly matters.

282
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,260
Some are ambitious.

283
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:30,090
