A ritual took place here.

563
00:30:54,910 --> 00:30:57,380
It's called the Three Primes Sun-Moon Great Peace Fasting Rite.

564
00:30:57,380 --> 00:30:57,990
Tiezui,

565
00:30:58,910 --> 00:31:00,130
remember to be concise.

566
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:01,570
All right.

567
00:31:01,830 --> 00:31:02,890
Sure.

568
00:31:06,110 --> 00:31:06,980
This ritual

569
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,370
was used to open

570
00:31:09,520 --> 00:31:10,890
the gates to Heaven.

571
00:31:11,310 --> 00:31:12,850
A gate will be opened here

572
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:14,090
that goes directly to Heaven.

573
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:16,030
However, a problem seemed to have happened.

574
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,180
The cause of the problem

575
00:31:33,390 --> 00:31:35,060
is probably the symbol on this flag.

576
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,540
The symbol on it

577
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:38,610
has been changed into the symbol of a cult.

578
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,330
A cult?

579
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:45,810
The ritual failed

580
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:47,650
and all of them died.

581
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,370
Stop spouting nonsense here.

582
00:31:56,520 --> 00:31:57,370
A failed ritual

583
00:31:57,390 --> 00:31:58,370
will never kill.

584
00:32:00,140 --> 00:32:00,650
Laogou.

585
00:32:00,840 --> 00:32:03,630
This spell opens a gate to Heaven.

586
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,610
If the flag is wrong,

587
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,060
the gate

588
00:32:05,790 --> 00:32:07,570
probably doesn't lead to Heaven, first of all.

589
00:32:08,550 --> 00:32:09,060
Second,

590
00:32:09,870 --> 00:32:10,780
where the door leads to

591
00:32:11,280 --> 00:32:12,370
is unknown.

592
00:32:26,040 --> 00:32:27,170
Although they didn't go to Heaven,

593
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,650
the Otherworld Patriarch proved that he could use spells.

594
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:30,850
He just didn't excel in it.

595
00:32:31,590 --> 00:32:32,460
He has achieved his goal, more or less.

596
00:32:33,070 --> 00:32:34,220
It is all fake.

597
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:39,610
The only objective of the Otherworld Tower

598
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,740
is to let the followers believe

599
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:43,940
that spells truly exist.

600
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:46,330
Throughout history, all this talk of spirits and the supernatural

601
00:32:47,590 --> 00:32:49,090
has been used to deceive the world.

602
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:52,330
I, Zhang Qishan, swear with my life,

603
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:56,740
that everything here is a lie.

604
00:33:02,590 --> 00:33:03,020
Tiezui,

605
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:06,120
if you have more proof to convince me,

606
00:33:06,120 --> 00:33:07,000
show me.

607
00:33:07,610 --> 00:33:08,410
If you can't,

608
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,520
I'll crush this place.

609
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,300
Master Zhang, I...

610
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,130
Yes, Master Zhang.

611
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,740
I'll surely find evidence for you.

612
00:33:25,830 --> 00:33:26,370
Over there.

613
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:28,090
Only a hand and a head

614
00:33:28,520 --> 00:33:29,130
passed through

615
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,890
and the passage was closed.

616
00:33:31,630 --> 00:33:32,570
The hand and head

617
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:34,810
were severed in the bodies of these followers.

618
00:33:35,390 --> 00:33:36,540
But look at this body.

619
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,300
It is complete

620
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,540
with the mouth open.

621
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,300
However, there's nothing inside.

622
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:42,220
That means

623
00:33:42,550 --> 00:33:43,170
at least,

624
00:33:43,350 --> 00:33:45,060
something made its way here successfully.

625
00:33:45,310 --> 00:33:46,740
It must be the shadow you chased after.

626
00:33:47,110 --> 00:33:48,460
The shadow was here for a long time?

627
00:33:49,520 --> 00:33:50,890
The ritual was carried out years ago,

628
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:51,780
but it only harms people recently?

629
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:54,020
What has the shadow been doing all this time?

630
00:33:55,150 --> 00:33:56,060
How would I know?

631
00:33:56,310 --> 00:33:57,170
Perhaps the shadow

632
00:33:57,630 --> 00:33:59,220
was still young when it just came here.

633
00:33:59,310 --> 00:34:00,740
It has only become an adult recently.

634
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:01,500
Whether it's a human

635
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:03,060
or a spirit,

636
00:34:04,070 --> 00:34:05,220
regardless of its objective

637
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:06,700
or what it wants us to do,

638
00:34:07,390 --> 00:34:08,650
I will never let it get its wish.

639
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:04,860
Master Qiansui.

640
00:35:04,900 --> 00:35:05,670
The building...

641
00:35:06,320 --> 00:35:07,940
The building is shaking.

642
00:35:08,450 --> 00:35:09,410
Don't be afraid.

643
00:35:11,810 --> 00:35:15,860
The more it shakes, the more it feels comfortable.

644
00:35:21,590 --> 00:35:22,380
Master.

645
00:35:22,730 --> 00:35:27,610
The unions and farewells of life are impossible to foresee.

646
00:35:29,040 --> 00:35:34,770
Let us watch the splendid play that unfolds this day.

647
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:45,340
Help

648
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:46,490
dig the waterway.

649
00:35:46,490 --> 00:35:46,980
- Yes! - Yes!

650
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:47,460
Don't move.

651
00:35:48,110 --> 00:35:49,290
It might collapse again.

652
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:57,380
Master Zhang.

653
00:35:58,240 --> 00:35:59,940
This is a common deep rock fracture.

654
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:01,570
The layers underneath have been flattened.

655
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:03,090
This road is definitely blocked.

656
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,860
I get it now!

657
00:36:19,590 --> 00:36:20,570
I get it now!

658
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,230
We are trapped here forever.

659
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:34,290
I get it now!

660
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:43,210
Speak.

661
00:36:47,520 --> 00:36:49,130
We are trapped here.

662
00:36:50,630 --> 00:36:51,610
The only waterway

663
00:36:52,070 --> 00:36:53,130
has collapsed.

664
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,090
We can't leave.

665
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:59,540
The only way to leave this place

666
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:01,250
is to carry out the Three Primes Sun-Moon Great Peace Fasting Rite

667
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:03,020
to connect to the other world.

668
00:37:03,850 --> 00:37:05,360
Then, there might still be a chance.

669
00:37:09,270 --> 00:37:09,940
Otherworld Patriarch.

670
00:37:10,380 --> 00:37:10,860
No.

671
00:37:11,240 --> 00:37:12,420
You are probably the shadow.

672
00:37:12,920 --> 00:37:13,690
Come out.

673
00:37:14,150 --> 00:37:14,980
I know you're here.

674
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,860
You used Unit 401

675
00:37:18,590 --> 00:37:19,940
to lure us here

676
00:37:20,630 --> 00:37:22,690
because you want us to carry out the ritual to send you home.

677
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,210
No need.

678
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:24,340
Unit 401 was already here.

679
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:25,650
Just let them carry out the ritual.

680
00:37:26,330 --> 00:37:27,170
Wu Laogou,

681
00:37:28,220 --> 00:37:29,570
don't run your mouth.

682
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,690
Besides,

683
00:37:32,850 --> 00:37:34,460
my dogs are not required for the ritual.

684
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:35,860
Return my dogs first.

685
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:40,900
All of you don't believe me.

686
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,500
All of you are looking down on me.

687
00:37:43,520 --> 00:37:44,940
Why don't we follow Tiezui's method first?

688
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:49,250
The people of the Wu Clan should do it first.

689
00:37:49,690 --> 00:37:50,700
We'll take responsibility if all of you die.

690
00:37:50,700 --> 00:37:51,420
Ridiculous!

691
00:37:56,300 --> 00:37:57,690
It'll take three years

692
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:59,250
for you to learn the spell now.

693
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:00,860
Don't underestimate my expertise.

694
00:38:01,040 --> 00:38:02,020
It's not that easy.

695
00:38:07,040 --> 00:38:07,730
Take him away.

696
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,060
Dream on.

697
00:38:12,190 --> 00:38:13,210
Tiezui has gone mad.

698
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:15,460
What do you think, Master Zhang?

699
00:38:16,750 --> 00:38:17,820
You don't believe in the supernatural.

700
00:38:18,110 --> 00:38:19,490
Carrying out a ritual is probably

701
00:38:19,490 --> 00:38:20,380
beneath you.

702
00:38:21,190 --> 00:38:22,540
Let me do it on your behalf.

703
00:38:23,750 --> 00:38:24,940
No need. We'll do it together.

704
00:38:25,320 --> 00:38:26,020
Just don't tell anyone after we escape.

705
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:27,860
Everyone,

706
00:38:29,190 --> 00:38:29,900
prepare for the ritual.

707
00:38:31,270 --> 00:38:32,420
Help Tiezui get changed.

708
00:38:56,630 --> 00:38:58,900
Everyone, pay attention to Tiezui's steps and rhythm.

709
00:39:00,070 --> 00:39:00,630
If the tower

710
00:39:00,630 --> 00:39:02,560
is hinting at us to carry out this ritual,

711
00:39:03,960 --> 00:39:05,820
while Tiezui is carrying out the ritual,

712
00:39:06,710 --> 00:39:08,250
his feet might step on some traps

713
00:39:08,630 --> 00:39:09,900
that create illusions.

714
00:39:23,190 --> 00:39:23,690
That's all?

715
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:25,820
That's all.

716
00:39:27,270 --> 00:39:27,980
That's all?

717
00:39:32,230 --> 00:39:32,770
Where's the gate?

718
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:34,380
Where is it?

719
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:44,650
The gate...

720
00:40:11,070 --> 00:40:11,690
Master,

721
00:40:13,040 --> 00:40:13,820
there's nothing inside.

722
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:28,650
- Master! - Master!

723
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:29,690
Master!

724
00:40:32,710 --> 00:40:33,380
Master!

725
00:40:34,610 --> 00:40:35,280
Master!

726
00:40:40,550 --> 00:40:41,610
The gate has indeed opened.

727
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:44,610
Zhang Qishan did go there.

728
00:40:46,070 --> 00:40:47,340
Why wasn't there any sound?

729
00:40:51,230 --> 00:40:51,730
Tiezui.

730
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,650
Help me do another ritual.

731
00:40:55,550 --> 00:40:56,340
No, Fifth Master.

732
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:57,730
Exactly. Even Master Zhang is gone.

733
00:40:57,750 --> 00:40:58,690
Since Zhang Qishan went there,

734
00:40:59,190 --> 00:40:59,980
Tianpeng and the rest

735
00:41:00,710 --> 00:41:01,770
might have gone there too.

736
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:03,820
I must take a look.

737
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,090
Otherwise, the Wu Clan

738
00:41:06,750 --> 00:41:07,940
will be looked down upon by the Zhang Clan.

739
00:41:08,750 --> 00:41:09,860
We promised to help them find Unit 401.

740
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:11,090
In the end, we failed

741
00:41:11,590 --> 00:41:12,730
and Zhang Qishan has gone missing.

742
00:41:13,750 --> 00:41:14,730
Even if we can return alive,

743
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,420
I'll be too embarrassed to stay in Changsha.

744
00:41:18,400 --> 00:41:19,900
What nonsense ritual.

745
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:22,340
Let me experience it.

746
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,860
Everyone, be on standby here.

747
00:41:25,590 --> 00:41:26,460
If I find something,

748
00:41:26,960 --> 00:41:28,060
I'll try to send a message back here.

749
00:41:29,070 --> 00:41:31,020
Tiezui, carry out the ritual.

750
00:41:32,040 --> 00:41:33,170
If I don't return,

751
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:35,570
follow Tiezui's orders for civilian matters.

752
00:41:37,040 --> 00:41:37,730
For matters about wars and fights,

753
00:41:40,300 --> 00:41:41,250
follow Madam Huo's orders.

754
00:41:56,550 --> 00:41:57,170
Come on.

755
00:41:58,230 --> 00:41:59,460
Tiezui, please carry out the ritual.

756
00:42:00,090 --> 00:42:01,380
- Laogou. - Enough.

757
00:42:02,390 --> 00:42:02,980
Hurry.

758
00:42:39,900 --> 00:42:40,500
Laogou.

759
00:42:41,230 --> 00:42:41,940
Laogou.

760
00:42:42,750 --> 00:42:43,940
- Fifth Master! - Fifth Master!

761
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:46,940
- Fifth Master! - Fifth Master!

762
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:48,500
- Laogou! - Fifth Master!

763
00:42:48,570 --> 00:42:49,380
Fifth Master!

764
00:43:06,300 --> 00:43:10,460
♪The past fades like smoke♪

765
00:43:10,820 --> 00:43:13,540
♪A choice is made in silence♪

766
00:43:13,820 --> 00:43:16,620
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

767
00:43:17,020 --> 00:43:20,780
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

768
00:43:21,020 --> 00:43:24,460
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

769
00:43:24,740 --> 00:43:28,140
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

770
00:43:28,220 --> 00:43:35,500
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

771
00:43:35,940 --> 00:43:39,220
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

772
00:43:39,500 --> 00:43:42,740
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

773
00:43:42,900 --> 00:43:46,940
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

774
00:43:47,140 --> 00:43:50,500
♪Who believes in fate?♪

775
00:43:50,740 --> 00:43:54,100
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

776
00:43:54,340 --> 00:43:57,620
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

777
00:43:57,940 --> 00:44:01,620
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

778
00:44:01,820 --> 00:44:05,060
♪Take care♪

779
00:44:05,060 --> 00:44:07,620
♪We once raced♪

780
00:44:07,700 --> 00:44:09,620
♪For the dawn♪

781
00:44:09,780 --> 00:44:13,060
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

782
00:44:13,180 --> 00:44:16,460
♪In the web of fate♪

783
00:44:16,460 --> 00:44:19,660
♪No one can escape♪

784
00:44:20,660 --> 00:44:22,500
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

785
00:44:22,660 --> 00:44:24,220
♪We too were young once♪

786
00:44:24,300 --> 00:44:27,740
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

787
00:44:27,940 --> 00:44:30,260
♪Keep the ember lit♪

788
00:44:30,380 --> 00:44:34,900
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

789
00:44:35,020 --> 00:44:37,980
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

790
00:44:38,220 --> 00:44:41,740
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

791
00:44:41,860 --> 00:44:45,620
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

792
00:44:45,940 --> 00:44:49,420
♪Who believes in fate?♪

793
00:44:49,580 --> 00:44:52,580
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

794
00:44:52,820 --> 00:44:56,580
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

795
00:44:56,740 --> 00:45:00,460
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

796
00:45:00,580 --> 00:45:12,020
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
